  "ground_truth": {
    "method": "in-EVM independent recompute (NOT a Python re-derivation)",
    "detail": "For each holder the fork test recomputes the value along the same walk the adapter takes but via independent interface reads: Staking = stk.balanceOf -> stk.convertToAssets -> (if stk.asset() is an ERC4626) waToken.convertToAssets; Rewards = RewardsController.calculateCurrentUserRewards, each reward token mapped to its bare reserve via UNDERLYING_ASSET_ADDRESS() (or itself for plain GHO). Asserts adapter getOracleBalanceForAsset == independent(staked + rewards) per reserve, plus protocolId == aave-v3-umbrella, positionId == abi.encode(stakeToken), and the per-leg PositionKind."
